\id EPH + 
\h Ephesus 
\toc1 Ephesus Mite Henga Paul Lekha Thot 
\toc2 Ephesus 
\toc3 Eph 
\mt1 EPHESUS  
\mt2 MITE HENGA  
\mt3 PAUL LEKHA THOT  
\is1 Christa a pankhomna  
\is1 Yeshua Christaa gou ichan dingu aloupi jal'a akiloma hinna!  
\is1 Ephesus lekhabu sung thu umdan  
\ip Ephesus Lekhathot hin ihin-lonau ajeh asunin ahi. Hiche lekhathot sunga hin akhang akhanga mihon thudoh ana bol jingu, “Hikoma (vannoiya) hi ipi bol dinga uma kahim?” ti adonbutna hin nalung atijatsah thei ahi. Nalunglut em? Lekhabu hi nangma tah in kisimin. Pathen to kilhon khomna thudol ipat pan bep'u ahin, chule hichu eiho phattou cheh chehna ding hung hiding ahiti, het angaiye. Hiche lekha thot sim'a kon hin Solchah Paul in ihinau kihetdohna le Pathen ngailutna chang ihiu kimudohna inei diu hi alung gon ahi. Nangman Pathen ami hina le ami ngailutna na chunga hi atepi bei ahi ti, nahin mudoh ding ahi \xt Eph 1:17-23; Eph 3:15-21\xt*. Hijeh chun Solchah Paul to kithokhomin Christa'a gou kichai tih umlou ahaona'a Pathen houkhomna jao ding in eiseipeh uve Ephesus 3:8. Solchah Paul in Ephesus lekha thot ajihna a hin, Christa tahsan jouse Lhagaova kipumkhat hina ding thua vetsahna jatchom chom eipeuve, ti mudoh theiyin aumin ahi.  
\is1 Lekha thot jihpa chule ajih kum  
\ip Solchah Paul in AD 60-62 don'a Rome khopia songkul atan laiya ajih ahi.  
\is1 Koi henga ajih ham?  
\ip Hiche lekhathot hi Solchah Paul'in Asia gamkai hop'a cheng, adeh'a Christian ho henga akhopiu-Ephesus mun'a umho dinga ajih ahi. Ephesus khopi hi milim houna munpi (Asia sung pumpia dinga Diana pathen'u houna in) kisahna'a chu numei hougut noti, mi sangkhat um-uva ahi. Chujongleh Pathen ngaisahlou chihna ngailu ho thuhil holeh lhagao kipui lamvaina doile ai-choi tamna khopi ahi. Hijeh a chu Paul hin atahsan thahho hi Christa to kipum khat hina le mithah ahina akihet diu deina'a hiche lekha thot hi anajih ahi.  
\c 1  
\p
\v 1 Hiche lekhathot hi Pathen lunglama Christa Yeshua solchah, Paul, a kon ahi. Keiman Pathen mithengte ho Christa Yeshua a tahsan umtah'a anung juiya pang Ephesus a umho henga kajih ahi.\x + \xo 1:1 \xt Act 18:19-21; 19:1\x*  
\v 2 I-Pau Pathen le Pakai Yeshua Christa chun nangho lungsetna le cham-lungmon napeu hen.   
\s1 Christa jal'a lhagao vangbohna  
\p
\v 3 I-Pakaiyu Yeshua Christa Pa chu vahchoina jouse chang hen: Ajeh chu eiho Christa to hing khoma ihitah jeh uvin, Ama chun eiho hi van munhoa lhagaolam phattheina tinchenga eiphatthei boh u ahi.  
\v 4 Aman vannoi leiset asem masanga jong Pathen in eingailut uva chule Christan atheng dinga eina lhendoh uva chule Amitmua suhkhel beihela eikoiyu ahitai.  
\v 5 Pathen in Ama insung mi hidinga Ahenga eipuiyu hi Yeshua Christa jal'a chapa lamthua eisem theina dingu alung gonsa le alunglhaina tah ahiye.  
\v 6 Hiti chun lungsetna loupi tah Achapa a angailutna ichunguva ahin sunlhahtah jeh in Pathen chu ivahchoiyun ahi.  
\v 7 Ama mihepina le lungset themna a haotah ahina jal a Aman ichonset nau ngaidam channa le Achapa thisan a ichamlhat nau manbeiya achohdoh ahitai.\x + \xo 1:7 \xt Col 1:14\x*  
\v 8 Aman Amihepina hi chihna le hetkhen themna jousea ichung uva ahin lhunsah ahitai.  
\v 9 Pathen in tua hi Christa chung chang thua, atohgon thuguh chu alung lhaina tah a asuhbulhit got eiho henga aphondoh ahitai.  
\v 10 Chule hiche atohgon chu: Aphatcha Aman ijakai Christa thuneina noiya vana hihen leichunga hijongleh ahin umkhom sah sohkei ding ahitai.  
\v 11 Chukalval'in, eiho Christa toh hingkhoma ihitah jeh uvin, eihon Pathena gouchan ding inei tauve, ajeh chu Aman amasanga einalhensau ahitan, chule Aman ijakai atohgonsa dungjuiya ahin tohdoh sohkei ahitai.  
\v 12 Pathen in ana lunggon umsa chu, eiho Judah mite hin, Christa a tahsan masate ihi jaluva Pathen chu vahchoina le loupina ipeh theina dingu ati ahi.  
\v 13 Chule tun chidang namdang nangho tah in jong, thutah, Pathen in nahuhhing nau Kipana Thupha thu chu naja tauve. Chule nanghon Christa natahsan uva chu Aman Amaa te nahi nau nahetpeh nauva Lhagao Theng chu napeh u ahi; hichu Aman masang peh a ana thutepsa ahitai.  
\v 14 Lhagao chu Pathen in anathutepsa igoulo dingu chu ahi atia chule hichu aman amite hidinga eina chohdoh sau ahitai. Hichu eihon Ama ivahchoiyuva chule loupina ipeh theina dingu ahi.   
\s1 Chihna le hetna dinga taona  
\p
\v 15 Keiman nangho Pakai Yeshua tahsanna a nahat'u chule muntina Pathen mite na ngailut nau thudol kana jah a pat chun,  
\v 16 Keiman nangho jal'in Pathen thangvahna tanglou hel'in kaneiyin, nangho dingin katao jingin ahi.  
\v 17 I-Pakaiyu Yeshua Christa Pa loupi tah chun lhagao lama chihna le lunggila mugilna napeh uva, hitia nangho Pathen nahet nauva nakhantou theina dingu ahi.  
\v 18 Nangho nalung sungu chu vah'in alonvuh dima hitia chu nanghon khonunga kinepna loupi tah, akouho peh dinga akitepna chu nanei theina ding uva katao ahi. Aman amite chu itobang tah a haona le loupina goulo ding apeh ham ti kagel doh sah nom nahiuve.  
\v 19 Chule kataona jong hi Ama tahsan hon Pathen thaneina ichan geiya len a ham ti nahetdoh theina dingu ahiye. Hiche hi chuche thahatna chungnung chun,  
\v 20 Christa chu athi lah a kona akaithouva chule Pathen khut jetlam jabolna'a Van mun'a chu atousah ahitai.\x + \xo 1:20 \xt Labu 110:1\x*  
\v 21 Tua hi Ama avaihoma, athuneiya, athaneiya, alamkaiya ahilouleh ipi dang hijongleh hiche vannoi sehseh a bou hilouva, amavang vannoi ahung umnalai chunga jong hinalai ahi.  
\v 22 \x + \xo 1:22 \xt Col 1:18\x*Pathen in thil ijakai Christa thuneina noija akoiya chule houbung phatchomna dinga thil jouse chunga aluchanga atun ahitai.\x + \xo 1:22 \xt Labu 8:6\x*  
\v 23 Chule houbung chu atahsa ahin, hichu Christa in ijakaiya Amaa adimsah a, abulhinsah a achamkimsah ahitai.   
\ms1 Thina a kon hinna  
\c 2  
\p
\v 1 Nangho khatvei chu nasei ngailou nau le na chonset nau tamtah jeh a athia nahi tauve.\x + \xo 2:1 \xt Col 2:13\x*  
\v 2 Nangho vannoi mite adang chengse tobanga chu chonset a hing nahiuva, Diabol thua nananun'u ahin, akimulou vannoi thuneiho thununna noiya uma nanahiuve. Amahi Pathen thua nunglou ho lungsunga natonga lhagao chu ahi.  
\v 3 Eiho jouse hitia chu ihin jiu anahin, tahsaa ilungtup hou le ichonset nau lung ngaichat ho chu juiya inahiu ahi. Eiho ihinau ngaiya chu midang dang ho tobanga eiho jong Pathen lunghanna noiya uma inahi tauve.  
\v 4 Hinlah Pathen hi khotona a haotah ahijeh'in, chule Aman eingailut lheh jeh uvin,  
\v 5 Eiho ichonset jeh uva athia inahi jeng vangun, Aman Christa chu athia kona akaithou tah jeh in, hinna chu Aman eipeh u ahitai (Nangho hi Pathen lungsetna jal'a bou huhhing nahiu ahi).  
\v 6 Ajeh iham itileh Aman eiho thinaa konin Christa to eikai thou tha tauvin, chule Amatoh vanmun hoa eitou sah tauve, ajeh chu eiho Christa Yeshua to hing khoma ihi tauve.  
\v 7 Hitia chu Pathen in ahung lhung ding khanghoa alungsetna atepibei haosatna chu avetsahna a chule ichung uva hepina chu eiho jouse dinga athilbol jouse chu Christa Yeshua a eimu sah u ahitai.  
\v 8 Nanghon natahsan pet uva chu Pathen in alungsetnaa na huhhingu ahitai. Chule nanghon hichu na kithang atpi theiyu ahipoi, Pathena kona thilpeh khat ahiye.  
\v 9 Huhhingna hi thilpha iboldoh jaluva tohman'a eiki peuva ahipoi, hitia hi i-lah uva koima akisonpia aumlouna dinga ahi.  
\v 10 Ajeh iham itileh eiho Pathen khutsoh ihiuve. Aman eiho Christa Yeshua a athah a eisemu hi, Aman masanga pat a eiho dinga atohgon thilpha ho chu iboldoh theina dingu ahi.   
\s1 Christa jal'a tipum khat  
\p
\v 11 Nangho chidang namdang ten gampam mi nahiu sumil hih un. Nangho hi chep kitanlou Pathen tahsanlou tia Juda miten nakouvu ahi, acheptanu kisonpia neiya, hichun atahsa uva bou amelchihna uma, alhagaovu vang hilou ahi.  
\v 12 Chuche laiya chu nangho Christa beiya nana hin'u ahi. Nangho Israel namsung mia kona khendoh a pamse nahiu ahin, chule nanghon Pathen in amaho toh akitepnaho chu nana hepouve. Nangho hiche vannoiya hi Pathen neilou le kinepna neilouva nahinu ahi.  
\v 13 Hinlah tua hi nangho Christa Yeshua to nahin khomu ahitai. Khatvei chu Pathena kona gamlatah nahiu ahin, tuavang hi Christa thisan jal'a Ama koma kipui naiya nahi tauve.  
\v 14 Ajeh iham itileh Christa chun eiho henga cham-lungmon ahinpoh lut ahitai. Aman Juda-mite le chidang namdang te kikah a kikhenna daltan abanglai a panga chu Atahsa tah a thingpel chunga khat a agopkhomsoh ahitai.  
\v 15 Athina a kon chun aman chidang namdangte hoptha lou hiche chonna dan ho chu achaina asem ahitai. Aman hiche abollo na ajeh chu Judahte le chidang namdangte kikah a kichamna umsah a anamniuva kona mithah khat semdoh ding ati ahi.\x + \xo 2:15 \xt Col 2:14\x*  
\v 16 Anilhon a chu tipum khat a agop khomtheina dinga Christa chu ania dinga thingpel a thia, chujala chu namthah asemdoh a, chule aniu kah a kitomona chu asuhmang ahitai.\x + \xo 2:16 \xt Col 1:20\x*  
\v 17 Aman hiche kichamna thupha chu Amaa kona gamla tah a um chidang namdang mi nangho henga, chule anailama um Juda-mite henga ahin lhut ahitai.\x + \xo 2:17 \xt Isa 57:19\x*  
\v 18 Tua hi eiho jouse hi Christan eibolpeh u ahitah jeh a, hiche Lhagao Theng vanga chu Pa henga ihung theiyu ahitai.  
\v 19 Hitia chu tua hi chidang namdang mi nangho hi kholgam mi le gampam mi hitalouva, Pathen mithengte jouse toh agam mi hina naneikhom'u ahitai. Nangho Pathen insungmi chu nahi tauve.  
\v 20 Akigoma eiho hi Ama in chu ihiuvin, solchah ho le themgao ho bulphuna a chu kisadoh a ihiuve. Inninga songpia panga chu Christa Yeshua Ama tah ahi.  
\v 21 Eiho chingtheitah a Amato kijopmat a ihiuvin, Pakai dinga hou-in theng khat ihiuve.  
\v 22 Ama vanga chu chidang namdang nangho jong Pathen in a-Lhagaova chenna in'a anei chu nahi tauve.   
\c 3  
\s1 Vannoi chidang namdang te dinga Paul natoh  
\p
\v 1 Hicheng jouse hi, Christa Yeshua a sohchang Paul keiman chidang namdang nangho phat chomna ding kagelna ahi.  
\v 2 Gah ngaito dia kiloma chu, Pathen in alungsetna homjal dinga mopohna keima eipeh hi chidang namdang nangho henga ahin lhut ahi naheuvin ahi.  
\v 3 Keiman agomlama kana jihna a, Pathen in athuguh alunggon chu keima eihetsah ahitai.  
\v 4 Keiman kajihsa nasim uva kon chun, Christa a hiche tohgon thua kahet gil dan hedoh thei tauvin nate.\x + \xo 3:4 \xt Col 1:26,27\x*  
\v 5 Hiche hi khang masa ho'ah Pathen in ana phongdoh pon, hinla tun a Lhagao jal in Aman asolchah thengho le themgao ho henga hiche hi ahin phongdoh tai.  
\v 6 Chule hiche hi Pathen lunggon ahi: chidang namdang le Juda mite Kipana Thupha tahsan Pathen chate ho chun ahaona gou chu kibang chet a chang ding ahiuve.  
\v 7 Ani lhona chu tipum kibang ahigel lhon in, chule ani lhona phattheina thutep chu chang gel ahi lhon hi Christa Yeshua a ahi jal jeh ahi.  
\v 8 Keima Pathen mite lah a imacha hiloupen hijeng jongleng, Aman Christa a gou kichaitih umlou chidang namdangho seipeh dinga alung gon chu lungset mana keima heng ahinlhut ahitai.  
\v 9 Keima hi hiche thuguh tohgon um chu mitin seipeh dinga eikilheng doh ahin, Pathen ijakai sempa chun, atil abula pat a aguh a akoisa ahitai.  
\v 10 Hicheho jousea Pathen lunggon chu houbung mangcha a, chihna a van munhoa ahaona chu mutheilou vaipoho le athunei ho jouse henga phondoh ding ati ahi.  
\v 11 Hiche hi tonsot'a atohgon ahin, hichu Christa Yeshua i-Pakaiyu jal'a atohdoh ding ahi.  
\v 12 Christa jal leh Ama itahsan jal uva, tua hi eiho lungngam tah leh kisong tah a Pathen angsung ilut theiyu ahitai.  
\v 13 Hijeh chun, hiche mun a keima chungthu kikholna ho jeh hin lunglha hihbeh un. Nangho jeh a keiman kagim thoh hi nanghon sahtah nahiu kihet un.   
\s1 Pathen mi ngailutna hetding  
\p
\v 14 Hiche ho jouse hi kagel chun, keima ka dilsun, Pa henga ka taovin ahi.  
\v 15 Ama hi van chunga hihen, leiset chunga hijongleh ijakai sempa ahi.  
\v 16 Keima kataona chu ahileh, aloupina, aLhagao Theng a kona aman nangho sunggila kona thahatna beitih nei louva napeh dingu hi ahi.  
\v 17 Chutengleh Christa chun Ama natahsan jaljeh uva nalungsung uva achen theina ding ahi. Pathen ngailutna a chu na jungkho uva chule nahat dohna ding uvin thuhtah in kivuilut un.  
\v 18 Chule nanghon Pathen mite jousen anei dingu ahi bangin, tahsan theina thaneina chu neiyun–Angailutna chu ichan geiya len a, saova, sang a, chule thuh a hitam!  
\v 19 Nanghon Christa ngailutna hi tepkha teiyun! hiche hetchet ding chu hetjoujai hihih jong leh. Chutengleh hinkho bulhingset pum chule Pathena kona thilboltheina puma nakisem pilhing diu ahi.  
\v 20 Tun loupina jouse chu, athilbol theina hattah a kona isunguva natong'ah, ithumu ahiloule igel'u kalval a hetjoujai hilou subulhit thei, Pathen a hita hen.  
\v 21 Houbung sunga chule Christa Yeshua a chun akhang khangin, atonsot tonsot'in loupina ama a hijing tahen, Amen.   
\c 4  
\s1 Lhagaova pumkhat hina  
\p
\v 1 Hiche jeh chun, Pakai kin bolna a sohchang keiman, Pathen in nakouvu ahitah jeh in, nakikou nau totoh in chonun tia nakom uva katao ahi.  
\v 2 Phatseh in kineosah un chule lungneng un. Khat chu khat chungah thoh hat'un, na ngailut nau jaljeh in khat in khat suhkhelna a kihepito cheh un.\x + \xo 4:2 \xt Col 3:12,13\x*  
\v 3 Lhagaova pumkhat hina dingin kiseh un, khat le khat chamna in kikan khomun.  
\v 4 Ajehchu nangho hi khonunga loupina kinem'a kikou nahi bangun, tipum khat ahin chule Lhagao jong khat ahi.  
\v 5 Pakai khat, tahsan khat chule baptize chan khat bou ahi,  
\v 6 Chule Pathen khat le Pa chu imajouse chung vum'a uma ahin, chule imajousea uma ahiye.  
\v 7 Hiti chu hijongleh, Aman eiho khat cheh hi manbei thilpeh aguntah chu, Christa hong phalna jal in, eipe cheh uvin ahi.  
\v 8 Hijeh chun Pathen Thubun aseiyin, “Ama achung sanglama akaltou chun, sohchang ho apuiyin chule Amite chu manbei thilpeh ho ape-in ahi,” akiti.\x + \xo 4:8 \xt Labu 68:18\x*  
\v 9 Melchih in, “Ama akaltou chun” kiti hi: Hiche hin Christa chu vannoi anoinung lama gakumsuh a ahi tina jong ahi.  
\v 10 Chule Ama agakumsuh a chu vanho jouse sanga jong sang joa kaltouva ahi, hitia chu Aman vannoi pumpi hi Amatah in adimset sah ahi.  
\v 11 Tun hiche ho hi Christa in a houbung dinga manbei thilpeh'a apeh ahi: Solchah ho, Themgao ho, Evangelist ho, Pastor ho chule Mihil ho ahiuve.  
\v 12 Amaho amopoh nau chu Pathen mite chu Pathen natohna a pang ding chule Christa tipum, houbung chu sahdohna dinga ahi.  
\v 13 Hiche hi eiho ibon chauva chutobang tahsanna a kipumkhat a chule Pathen chapa hetna lama Pakaiya ipilhin theina ding uva, Christa a idim uva chule chamkimna a ichejompeh theina dingu ahi.  
\v 14 Chutengleh eiho chapang ho banga pilhing louva iumlou dingu ahitai. Eiho hi thuhil thah hui hung nung tobang ahung ho chun eimut lonle le lou dingu ahitai. Eiho hi mihon jouva eihin doha bol teng uleh thutah banga chingtheitah a asei dingu ahi.  
\v 15 Chusangin, eihon thutah chu ngailutna neiyin seiyu hite, imalam jousea khangtouva Christa (Houbung Luchang), Atipum (Christa tahsa) dinga ihi theina dingu ahi.  
\v 16 Aman atipumpi chu chamkim keiya asuhto sohkei ahi. Tibah hon ama ama kin hoitah a akibol cheh uva ahileh hiche hin tibah dang jong akhantou sah ahi, hitia chu tipumpi chu damthei le khangtouva chule ngailutna dimset hiji ahi.\x + \xo 4:16 \xt Col 2:19\x*   
\s1 Christa jal'a hinkho thah  
\p
\v 17 Pakai thuneina'a hiche hi kasei ahi: chidang namdang ho bolngai bangin bol tahih un, ajeh chu amaho tah kinepna beiya lungnoh phah bep ahiuve.  
\v 18 Alunggelu muthim lhangkhal kiheh ahin, amaho Pathen in hinkho apehna uva konin akihei mangun, Pathen in amaho apeh u lungthim chu akhah chah un chule Ama dounan alungu atahsah cheh un ahi.  
\v 19 Amahon jachat lamjong ahepouve. Amaho tahsa lung ngaichat nan ahinguvin chule then louna lam jousea akipeuvin ahi.  
\v 20 Hinlah hichu Christaa kona nakihilu ahipoi.  
\v 21 Nanghon Yeshua thu najah u ahitan, chule Amaa kona thutah chu kihil'a nahi tauve.  
\v 22 Na chonset luiyu chonna le masang nahinkhou then louna lung ngaichat le doha lhahna chu pailha uvin.\x + \xo 4:22 \xt Col 3:9\x*  
\v 23 Chusangin, Lhagao chun nalunggel ule ngaito nau suthahjo hen.  
\v 24 Na chonnau athah Pathen lim tobang pu–chonpha tahbeh le atheng chu kivonun.\x + \xo 4:24 \xt Col 3:10; \xt Semtilbu 1:26\x*  
\v 25 Hijeh chun jousei pailha tauvin. I-heng le ikom ho henga thutah chu seitau hite, ajeh chu eiho jouse hi tipum khat a chu jaova ihisoh keiyuve.\x + \xo 4:25 \xt Zechariah 8:16\x*  
\v 26 Chule chonset sodohna lunghan chun na thunun da tauhen. Nalunghan pet pum in nisa kilhum khum sah hih un.\x + \xo 4:26 \xt Labu 4:4\x*  
\v 27 Ajehchu lunghan na hin Diabol dinga pansatna apeh ahi.  
\v 28 Gucha nahileh, guhchat ngajeng in. Chusang chun, nakhut teni chu thilpha hatoh nan mangchan, chujou teng angaicha ho chu hongphal tah in pen.  
\v 29 Paongeilou le thuphalou seihih in. Nasei chasun chu apha le aphachom ding hihen, hiti chun nathusei ngaiho dinga kitil khouna sohdoh hen.  
\v 30 Na hinkho mandan u chu Pathen Lhagao Theng lung himosahna hida hen. Aman Amaa mong monga lhatdamna nikhoa nangho huhhing na channa ding uva namel chih u ahitai.  
\v 31 Lungdam louna jouse, lungsat, lunghan, thungai lou sei, chule seiset oimona, chule chonchan phalou jouse chu paimang un.  
\v 32 Chusangin, khat le khat kilungsetto cheh un, lungneng un, khat le khat kingaidam touvin, Christa in nangho na ngaidam bang uvin ngaidamun.\x + \xo 4:32 \xt Col 3:13\x*   
\c 5  
\s1 Khovah chate bang in chon un  
\p
\v 1 Hijeh chun imalam jousea Pathen umchan jomun, ajeh chu nangho Ama deilhen chate nahiuve.  
\v 2 Ngailutna dimset hinkho manguvin, Christa in avetsahna nung chu juiyun. Aman eingailut uva, chule Amatah hung kipedoh a Pathena dinga gimnam tuiya kipedoh a ahitai.\x + \xo 5:2 \xt Potdohbu 29:18; Labu 40:6\x*  
\v 3 Nalah uva jon-thanhoina, thenlouna, ahilouleh chipset umdahen. Hitobang chonsetnaho hin Pathen mite lah a mun aneipoi.  
\v 4 Phatchomna bei thusim seiho, ngol-hoi thusei, alam louva totnaho-hiche hohi nangho hina ahipoi. Chusangn in, Pathen thangvahna sohjo hen.  
\v 5 Nahet chet diuva pha chu–jonthanhoi, thenlouna, ahilouleh michipse ho Christa le Pathen Lenggam lutlou ding ahiuve. Ajeh chu michipse kiti hi milim hou ahin, hiche vannoi thil hohi pathena anei ahitai.  
\v 6 Hiche chonset hoa kithem chan ho dohan lhahih hel un, ajeh chu Pathen lunghan chu Ama seingailou ho jouse chunga chu ding ahi.  
\v 7 Hiche mihon thil abol nauva hin jao hihbeh in.  
\v 8 Ajehchu nangho khatvei chu muthim lhangkhal kihehleu lah a uma nana hiuvin, hinla tun nanghon Pakaiya kona vah chu naneiyu ahitai. Hijeh chun vahmite hin'in hing uvin.  
\v 9 Ajehchu hiche vah nasung uva kona hungvah doh chun apha le adih chule thutah ahin hindoh sah ding ahi.  
\v 10 Pakai lunglhaina ipi ahi chu chingthei tah in holdoh un.  
\v 11 Phatchomna bei agiloupa le muthim natoh hoa chun pan lahih un, chusangin sosal jouvin.  
\v 12 Pathen ngaisahlou hon guhthima athilbol hou hi gahsei dinga jong jachat umtah ahi.  
\v 13 Hinlah amaho lungput phalou chu achungu vah'in ahinsal tengleh kilang doh ding ahi.  
\v 14 Ajehchu vah'in ijakai atahlang ding ahi. Hiche jeh a hi hitia hi kiseiya ahi, “Vo ihmumil, athilah a konin thoudoh in, chule Christa in nangma nasalvah ding ahi.”  
\v 15 Hijeh chun itobang hinkho mang nahiu ching theiyun. Mingol ho tobang'in hinkho mang hih un, achingho tobang'in hing jouvin.  
\v 16 Tulai nikho phalou lah a hin phat kijenpet cha hi mang themun.\x + \xo 5:16 \xt Col 4:5\x*  
\v 17 Lung geltoh louvin chon hih un, hinla Pakaiyin ipi nabol ding uva adei chu hedoh un.  
\v 18 Lengpitwi don khamhih un, ajeh chu hichun nahinkhou amah thah sah ding ahi. Chusangin, Lhagao Thenga dimset un.  
\v 19 Vahchoina la ho le Pathen houna la chule lhagaolam laho nangma ho lah a sauvin, chule nalunggilun Pakaiya tumging tothon sauvin.\x + \xo 5:19 \xt Col 3:16,17\x*  
\v 20 Chule imalam jousea Pa Pathen chu IPakaiyu Yeshua Christa minin thangvah un.   
\s1 Pasalho le ajiteu  
\p
\v 21 Chule akalvalin, Christa jana jal in khat chu khat thua kitulut'un.  
\v 22 Nute ho, Pakai thua nung tobang'in najipa teu thu thun nungun.\x + \xo 5:22 \xt Col 3:18; 1 Pet 3:1\x*  
\v 23 Ajehchu jipa khat chu Christa Houbung luchang ahi tobanga jipa chu ajinu dinga aluchang ahi. Ama hi Atahsa pum, hichu Houbung Huhhingpu chu ahije.  
\v 24 Houbung Christa thua nung ahibangin, hitobangma chun nute ho jong najipa teu thunoiya imalam jousen umun.  
\v 25 Chule nangho pate hon, Christa in Houbung angailut tobang chun, najinu teu chu ngailuvin. Aman amanu dinga ahinkho apeh'a\x + \xo 5:25 \xt Col 3:19; 1 Pet 3:7\x*  
\v 26 amanu chu athen'a chule angimsel na dinga Pathen Thule baptize kibol'a kona asilngim ahi.  
\v 27 Hiche aman abol hi amanu hi Amaa dinga Loupi tah Houbung chu ahia anenlai, ahilouleh akohlai, ahilouleh adang nolna thei mun umlouna dinga abol ahi. Chusanga, amanu hi atheng le nolna bei hiding ahije.  
\v 28 Hitobangma chu, jipa tehon jong ajinu teu chu atahsau banga angailut dingu ahi. Ajehchu mihem khat ajinu ngailua chun amatah kingailua ahi ti avetsah e.  
\v 29 Christa in a-Houbung avettup tobang chun koiman ama tahsa ahotbol ngaipoi, chusangin avah jingin chule avetup jinge.  
\v 30 Chule eiho Ama tipuma atibah ho ihiuve.  
\v 31 Pathen Thubun asei tobang'in, “Pasal in apa le anu adalhah'a, chule ajinua beh ding ahi, chule ani lhona khat a kigom khom lhon ahitai.”\x + \xo 5:31 \xt Semtilbu 2:24\x*  
\v 32 Hichea hi thuguh kidang tah uma ahi, hinla hichea hi Christa le houbung khat ahina vetsahna ahi.  
\v 33 Hijeh a hi avela kasei ahi, pasal khat cheh in amatah akingailut tobanga ajinu chu angailut teiding ahi, chule jinu chun ajipa chu aja ding ahi.   
\c 6  
\s1 Thua nun chule ngailutna  
\p
\v 1 Chateho, Pakaiya nahitah jeh uvin nanu le napa teu thun nungun, ajeh chu hiche hi thildih bolding dol chu ahi.\x + \xo 6:1 \xt Col 3:20\x*  
\v 2 Napa le nanu jabolin. Hiche hi thutepto kigoma thupeh amasa ahi.\x + \xo 6:2 \xt Potdohbu 20:12; Danbu Ni Na 5:16\x*  
\v 3 Nangman napa le nanu najabola ahileh, “nangma dinga thil ijakai hoile pha hung hi ding, chule leiset chunga hi na hinkho sot ding ahi.”  
\v 4 Pateho, nachateu chu sasahna nanei nauva kona lunghan sahna bol hih'un. Chusangin, Pakaiya kona thununna le thuhilnaa seiletsah jouvin.\x + \xo 6:4 \xt Col 3:21\x*  
\v 5 Soh ho, leiset a napakai teu phatah a jabolna le ginna nei pumin athu uva nungun. Nanghon Christa najen ding bangtah u chun jen un.\x + \xo 6:5 \xt Col 3:22-25\x*  
\v 6 Amaho chun na vet-vet pet bouva hilouvin, phat jousen lunglhaisah un. Christaa sohchang nahijal un, Pathen lunglam chu nalung pum piuvin bol un.  
\v 7 Halpel in na tongun, miho dinga hilouvin Pakaiya dinga natong hijouvin.  
\v 8 Geldoh un, Pakaiyin thilpha bol jeh a, eiho khat khat cheh hi tohman eipeh cheh dingu ahi, soh hihen, achamlhat ah hijongleh,  
\v 9 Hitobangma chun pakaiho, nasohteu chu hitima chun bol un. Amaho chu hutum-gihsal bolhih un, nanghon nani lhona vana Pakai khat naneiyu ahi geldoh-un chule Ama chun koima maipha avepoi.\x + \xo 6:9 \xt Col 4:1; \xt Danbu Ni Na 10:17; Col 3:25\x*   
\ms1 Pathen Galvon  
\p
\v 10 Achaina keiyin: Pakaiya chule athahat thilbol theinaa chun hat un,  
\v 11 Pathen galvon ho jouse kivonun hitia chu Diabol doha tintang ho nanan jou sohkeina diu ahi.  
\v 12 Ajehchu eiho tahsaphe le thisanpua (mihem) melmato chun kidouva ihipouve, hinla agilou vaipo hotoh chule mutheilou vannoiya athuneiho toh, hiche vannoi muthim lah a hattah a thanei vaipo hotoh, chule van munhoa lhagao gilou engse hotoh kidouva ihiuve.  
\v 13 Hijeh a chu, nikho phalounia melma chu nadou jou theiyuva, nalethuh jouna dingun Pathen galvon chengse panun. Chujongleh gal akichai jouva jong nangho nadindet jom jingna dingu ahi.  
\v 14 Nadin nauva chun pang det un, thutah konggah in kigah un, chule tipum chu Pathen chonphatna galvon in kivonun.\x + \xo 6:14 \xt Isa 11:5; \xt Isa 59:17\x*  
\v 15 Kipana Thupha a kona bulhingset a kigosadema naumtheina dingun chamna chu kengchot in kiseuvin.\x + \xo 6:15 \xt Isa 52:7\x*  
\v 16 Hicheng jouse chungvuma chun, Diabol meikou-thalchangho chu suhmit na dingin tahsan lumdal chu dom sangun.  
\v 17 Huhhingna chu lukhuh in neiyun, chule Lhagao chemjam Pathen Thu chu panun.\x + \xo 6:17 \xt Isa 59:17\x*  
\v 18 Lhagaovin phat bih nei jousea le thilsoh jousea tao jingun. Limgehchan umjingun chule muntina mithengte ho jouse dingin nataonauva pangdet jingun.  
\v 19 Chule keima dingin jong taovun. Pathen in aphat phat cha thuho eipeh a ngamtah a Pathen thuguh Kipana Thupha alunggon chu Judah mite le chidang namdangho jouse ding ahi hi kahil chet theina dingin.  
\v 20 Keima Pathen Palai kahi naa, hiche thu kaseiphong jeh'a thihkhaova kihena kahi. Hiti ahijeh chun, Ama dinga kaseiphong dingdola lung ngamtah a kasei jing theina dingin neitaopeh un.   
\s1 Akhumkha taona  
\p
\v 21 \x + \xo 6:21 \xt Col 4:7,8\x*Tychicus hin keiman ipi kabola chule itobanga kimanchahna kanei ahi thudol bulhing keiya naseipeh dingu ahinai. Ama hi Pakai natohnaa sopi deitah le kithopipha tahsan umtah ahi.\x + \xo 6:21 \xt Act 20:4; 2 Tim 4:12\x*  
\v 22 Ama naheng uva dinga kahinsol lona ajeh hi-nangho tilkhou ding le keiho ikatiu hetsah ding kagelkhoh u ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Kasopi deitahteho, cham-lungmonna in naumpiu hen, chule Pa Pathen le Pakai Yeshua Christa chun ngailutna le kitahna napeuhen.  
\v 24 Pathen milungsetna chu tonsot'in i-Pakaiyu Yeshua Christa ngailuho jouse chunga umhen.   